    "qualified": "All declared authority predicates are supported for the exact operation and time. Continue to a separate destination/effect gate; do not infer dispatch.",
    "denied": "At least one mandatory authority predicate is established false. Do not dispatch.",
    "indeterminate": "Evidence is missing, stale, unsupported or outside its declared boundary. Hold and obtain evidence or reconcile.",
    "divergent": "Admissible sources or histories contradict each other. Preserve both and surface divergence."
  },
